{'symbol': 'BKR', 'date': '2023-01-25 16:15:00', 'title': 'BAKER HUGHES DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON AND LONDON, JAN. 25, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BAKER HUGHES (NASDAQ: BKR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE BAKER HUGHES BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $.19 PER SHARE OF CLASS A COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON FEB. 17, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON FEB. 6, 2023.'}